  "raw_block": "<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Rec Swim Hours</h3>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Rec swim hours are subject to change; check the website regularly before coming in*.</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Lanes are available on a first-come, first-served basis during the following times for recreational lap swimming only.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*<strong><em>Updated 8/24/26</em></strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Comp Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 8/24: 12pm-1pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 8/25: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 8/26: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 8/27: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 8/28: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 8/29: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 8/30: 11am-2pm</p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Dive Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 8/24: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 8/25: 6am-8am &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 8/26: 6am-8am, 4pm-5pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 8/27: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 8/28: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 8/29: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 8/30: Closed</p>"
